1:["$","$Le",null,{"record":{"slug":"food-award","section":"practice","title":["“以食为天”全国竞赛获奖","Food Ecology: national competition recognition"],"date":"2025.09","status":["荣誉记录","Recognition"],"summary":["团队以大食物馆及相关乡建实践参加第三届中国研究生“美丽中国”创新设计大赛。","The team entered the third Beautiful China postgraduate design competition with the pavilion and related rural practice."],"topic":true,"chapters":[{"title":["研究与实践的汇报","Presenting research and practice"],"text":["总决赛线下答辩于2025年9月23—24日在哈尔滨举行。10月3日的报道记载团队获一等奖及十佳相关奖项；后者正式名称在原文中有不同写法，待证书核对。","The final presentations took place in Harbin on 23–24 September 2025. The 3 October report records a first prize and a top-ten award, whose exact title varies within the article."]}],"related":["diverse-foods","milan-food","food-media"],"sources":["award"]}}]
